{"id":"6d18cde14fb0596b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Inductive.md","title":"Inductive","display":"Inductive","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Inductive","parameters":["a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Inductive"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Inductive a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (exists e (and (@ Empty e) (in e a)))\n  (forall x (implies (in x a) (exists y (and (@ Succ x y) (in y a))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Inductive a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Empty","status":"resolved","id":"b6471a8f381739eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Succ","status":"resolved","id":"1d9ce9ba5108a31b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Empty|Empty]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":806,"backlinks":[{"id":"3bcf6cd1d43a3007","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Inductive|Inductive]]；[[ZFC_Subset|Subset]]"},{"id":"0fa0ebf32e0e4a89","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Inductive|Inductive]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_Inductive|Inductive]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","b6471a8f381739eb","1d9ce9ba5108a31b","593f9bdab4d60707"]}